==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[raja]]

===Etymology===
From [[Hindustani]] {{term|sc=Deva|राजा|tr=rājā|lang=hi}} / {{term|sc=ur-Arab|راجا|tr=rājā|lan=ur}} < {{etyl|sa}} {{term|sc=Deva|राजन्|tr=rājan||king, prince|lang=sa}}.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia|raja}}
{{en-noun}}

# a [[Hindu]] [[prince]] or [[ruler]] in [[India]]

